00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:51,290
And now, let's see how an accounting firm solved 4TB of local file chaos in our first enterprise case study on Slide 11!

10
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:56,470
This case study is wild—wait until you hear how much time CPAs were wasting!

